# FARMER'S CARRY

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

The Farmer's Carry is a loaded locomotion exercise performed while walking with heavy external loads held at the sides.

Within CAS, it is considered one of the highest-value exercises for developing grip strength, trunk stiffness, postural integrity and whole-body work capacity.

---

# Philosophy

Strength is not only demonstrated by lifting.

It is also demonstrated by carrying.

The Farmer's Carry teaches athletes to maintain posture, generate whole-body tension and produce force while moving.

CAS frequently selects this exercise because it develops multiple athletic qualities simultaneously with exceptional transfer to combat sports.

