# Final Principle

The Farmer's Carry teaches athletes to remain strong while moving.

Few exercises simultaneously develop grip,

posture,

core stiffness,

whole-body coordination,

and work capacity

with such a favorable stimulus-to-fatigue ratio.

For this reason,

it belongs among the highest-value exercises in the CAS knowledge base.